6. Core Functionality
6.1 Data Acquisition
NASA Weather Data
•	Click Connect to NASA.
•	Enter a location (latitude/longitude or city), or click on the side map to select the area whose weather data you want to fetch — this method is fast and effective.
•	Specify the date range and fetch the data.

Local Data Import
•	Supported: Excel (.xlsx/.xls), CSV, AquaStream360 files
•	Steps: Click Import, select file → automatic column detection
6.2 Data Processing
•	Automatic: Identify dates, sort chronologically, remove duplicates, handle missing values, format data
•	Manual: Round values, reset, clear views, custom formatting
6.3 Statistical Analysis
•	Descriptive statistics: Mean, median, standard deviation
•	Correlation matrices
•	Variation analysis
•	Trend identification
