10. Troubleshooting & Support
Common Issues
•	NASA data not loading → Check internet, date range, coordinates
•	Loading taking too long → Poor internet 
•	Import errors → Verify format, remove special characters
•	Performance issues → Reduce dataset, close other apps
Error Reporting
•	Click Report Issues, describe problem, steps to reproduce, submit details
•	Collected info: Error type, function, data characteristics, system config
Support Resources
•	Built-in tooltips and context guidance
•	Example datasets and tutorial prompts
Best Practices
•	Clean data before import
•	Use consistent date formats
•	Remove unnecessary columns
•	Validate numeric ranges
•	Backup projects, use clear naming, version control
